      "settings": {
        "title": "Car Models",
        "html": "<div class=\"card__section expandable-content expandable-content--expandable\" aria-expanded=\"false\" style=\"padding: 5px\">\n<div class=\"rte text--pull\">\nWhatever type of car model you are looking for Hearns Hobbies has plenty of optionsfor you.  If you are into RC or remote control cars we have a selection of RTR (ready to run) and kits available for you to choose.  If you like assembling plastic model kits then we have an extensive range of model car kits.  We also have a good range of diecast cars in a range of different scales. For the real car enthusiast we have a range of exclusive, premium quality collectible resin cars.  As well as that we have the current slot cars produced to suit the main brands of slot car sets.\n</div>\n<button class=\"expandable-content__toggle\" style=\"padding:5px\">                             <span class=\"expandable-content__toggle-icon\"></span>                         <span class=\"expandable-content__toggle-text\" data-view-more=\"View more\" data-view-less=\"View less\">View more</span>                    </button>\n</div>"
